us-local-greenwood-village-opt	1999	fixed	{"amount":2,"minimumEarnings":250,"per":"month"}	https://web.archive.org/web/19990421080049/http://www.greenwoodvillage.com:80/finance/bro2.html	Employee occupational privilege tax $2.00 per month when the employee earns $250.00 or more in a calendar month (employers pay a matching $2.00); the brochure says the tax has existed since January 1, 1980 (city tax brochure, Wayback capture of April 21, 1999). Amounts before 1999 are not documented.	f
us-local-greenwood-village-opt	2000	fixed	{"amount":2,"minimumEarnings":250,"per":"month"}	https://web.archive.org/web/20030425213216/http://www.greenwoodvillage.com:80/finance/occupationaltax.pdf	Carried between the city's tax brochure (Wayback capture of April 21, 1999) and its OPT return form (Wayback capture of April 25, 2003), both $2.00 per month on employees earning $250 or more in the month; no document for this year was located.	f
