us-local-greenwood-village-opt	2003	fixed	{"amount":2,"minimumEarnings":250,"per":"month"}	https://web.archive.org/web/20030425213216/http://www.greenwoodvillage.com:80/finance/occupationaltax.pdf	City occupational privilege tax return form (Wayback capture of April 25, 2003): $2.00 for each employee who earned a minimum of $250.00 per month working in the city, plus the employer's matching $2.00.	f
