 apply to income classes twice as large, so marriedJoint doubles each bracket. The state's own income tax is deductible in computing the tax (table footnote; not modelled). Community property state (in general half the community income is taxable to each spouse). Later editions print a different schedule (0.9%-9% from the 1976-77 ed.) and give the joint schedule only as a range, so this file takes 1972 from the statute history and 1974-1976 from Laws 1974, ch. 88 (see those entries); 1977-1985 are not recorded.	f
